This is a placeholder for the Nasalization-Rg-Regular font file.

To use the actual font, please:
1. Obtain a licensed copy of Nasalization-Rg-Regular font
2. Convert it to .woff2 format
3. Replace this file with the actual font file

You can use online tools like https://cloudconvert.com/ttf-to-woff2 to convert your font file.
